/gate/scatterer2/geometry/setXLength        10 mm
/gate/scatterer2/geometry/setYLength        10 mm
/gate/scatterer2/geometry/setZLength        1 mm
/gate/scatterer2/setMaterial                Vacuum

#================== ABSORBER =============================
